{"id":279,"slug":"279-string-methods-moi-trong-es6-nhu-padstart-padend-includes-startswith-la-gi","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"ES6+","level":"beginner","question_vi":"String methods mới trong ES6+ như padStart, padEnd, includes, startsWith là gì?","question_en":"What are the new String methods in ES6+ like padStart, padEnd, includes, startsWith?","answer_vi":"Nhóm method chuỗi thêm từ ES6 trở đi, thay được phần lớn regex đơn giản:\n\n```javascript\n// kiểm tra nội dung\n'hello world'.includes('world')     // true — thay indexOf(...) !== -1\n'file.pdf'.endsWith('.pdf')         // true\n'https://a.vn'.startsWith('https')  // true\n\n// đệm cho đủ độ dài\n'5'.padStart(3, '0')      // '005'  — số thứ tự, mã đơn\n'9'.padEnd(4, '.')        // '9...'\n\n// cắt khoảng trắng một phía\n'  x  '.trimStart()       // 'x  '\n'  x  '.trimEnd()         // '  x'\n\n// thay tất cả\n'a-b-c'.replaceAll('-', '_')   // 'a_b_c'  — replace() chỉ đổi lần đầu\n\n// lặp\n'ab'.repeat(3)            // 'ababab'\n\n// truy cập âm\n'hello'.at(-1)            // 'o'\n```\n\nHai điểm hay bị hỏi thêm:\n\n**1. `includes` phân biệt hoa thường** — muốn không phân biệt phải tự chuẩn hoá:\n\n```javascript\na.toLowerCase().includes(b.toLowerCase())\n```\n\n**2. `replaceAll` với chuỗi thì an toàn, với regex thì bắt buộc cờ `g`:**\n\n```javascript\n'a.b'.replaceAll('.', '-')      // 'a-b'\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./, '-')     // TypeError — thiếu cờ g\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./g, '-')    // 'a-b'\n```\n\n**Lưu ý với tiếng Việt:** các method này làm việc theo **code unit UTF-16**, nên `'Đ'.length` là 1 nhưng emoji hay ký tự tổ hợp có thể cho kết quả bất ngờ — cần chính xác theo ký tự thì dùng `Intl.Segmenter` hoặc `[...str]`","answer_en":"The string methods added from ES6 onward, which replace most simple regex work:\n\n```javascript\n// content checks\n'hello world'.includes('world')     // true — replaces indexOf(...) !== -1\n'file.pdf'.endsWith('.pdf')         // true\n'https://a.com'.startsWith('https') // true\n\n// padding to a length\n'5'.padStart(3, '0')      // '005'  — sequence numbers, order codes\n'9'.padEnd(4, '.')        // '9...'\n\n// one-sided trimming\n'  x  '.trimStart()       // 'x  '\n'  x  '.trimEnd()         // '  x'\n\n// replace every occurrence\n'a-b-c'.replaceAll('-', '_')   // 'a_b_c'  — replace() only changes the first\n\n// repetition\n'ab'.repeat(3)            // 'ababab'\n\n// negative indexing\n'hello'.at(-1)            // 'o'\n```\n\nTwo common follow-ups:\n\n**1. `includes` is case-sensitive** — normalize yourself for a case-insensitive check:\n\n```javascript\na.toLowerCase().includes(b.toLowerCase())\n```\n\n**2. `replaceAll` is safe with strings but requires the `g` flag with a regex:**\n\n```javascript\n'a.b'.replaceAll('.', '-')      // 'a-b'\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./, '-')     // TypeError — missing g flag\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./g, '-')    // 'a-b'\n```\n\n**Unicode caveat:** these methods work on **UTF-16 code units**, so emoji and combining characters can surprise you. For true per-character work, use `Intl.Segmenter` or `[...str]`","answer_html_vi":"<p>Nhóm method chuỗi thêm từ ES6 trở đi, thay được phần lớn regex đơn giản:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// kiểm tra nội dung\n'hello world'.includes('world')     // true — thay indexOf(...) !== -1\n'file.pdf'.endsWith('.pdf')         // true\n'https://a.vn'.startsWith('https')  // true\n\n// đệm cho đủ độ dài\n'5'.padStart(3, '0')      // '005'  — số thứ tự, mã đơn\n'9'.padEnd(4, '.')        // '9...'\n\n// cắt khoảng trắng một phía\n'  x  '.trimStart()       // 'x  '\n'  x  '.trimEnd()         // '  x'\n\n// thay tất cả\n'a-b-c'.replaceAll('-', '_')   // 'a_b_c'  — replace() chỉ đổi lần đầu\n\n// lặp\n'ab'.repeat(3)            // 'ababab'\n\n// truy cập âm\n'hello'.at(-1)            // 'o'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// kiểm tra nội dung</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello world&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;world&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — thay indexOf(...) !== -1</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;file.pdf&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">endsWith</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.pdf&#x27;</span>)         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://a.vn&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">startsWith</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https&#x27;</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đệm cho đủ độ dài</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;5&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">padStart</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;005&#x27;  — số thứ tự, mã đơn</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;9&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">padEnd</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.&#x27;</span>)        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;9...&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// cắt khoảng trắng một phía</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;  x  &#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trimStart</span>()       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;x  &#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;  x  &#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trimEnd</span>()         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;  x&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// thay tất cả</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a-b-c&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a_b_c&#x27;  — replace() chỉ đổi lần đầu</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// lặp</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ab&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">repeat</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>)            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;ababab&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// truy cập âm</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">at</span>(-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;o&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Hai điểm hay bị hỏi thêm:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. <code>includes</code> phân biệt hoa thường</strong> — muốn không phân biệt phải tự chuẩn hoá:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"a.toLowerCase().includes(b.toLowerCase())\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toLowerCase</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(b.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toLowerCase</span>())</code></pre></div><p><strong>2. <code>replaceAll</code> với chuỗi thì an toàn, với regex thì bắt buộc cờ <code>g</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"'a.b'.replaceAll('.', '-')      // 'a-b'\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./, '-')     // TypeError — thiếu cờ g\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./g, '-')    // 'a-b'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a-b&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/\\./</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TypeError — thiếu cờ g</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/\\./g</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a-b&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý với tiếng Việt:</strong> các method này làm việc theo <strong>code unit UTF-16</strong>, nên <code>'Đ'.length</code> là 1 nhưng emoji hay ký tự tổ hợp có thể cho kết quả bất ngờ — cần chính xác theo ký tự thì dùng <code>Intl.Segmenter</code> hoặc <code>[...str]</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>The string methods added from ES6 onward, which replace most simple regex work:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// content checks\n'hello world'.includes('world')     // true — replaces indexOf(...) !== -1\n'file.pdf'.endsWith('.pdf')         // true\n'https://a.com'.startsWith('https') // true\n\n// padding to a length\n'5'.padStart(3, '0')      // '005'  — sequence numbers, order codes\n'9'.padEnd(4, '.')        // '9...'\n\n// one-sided trimming\n'  x  '.trimStart()       // 'x  '\n'  x  '.trimEnd()         // '  x'\n\n// replace every occurrence\n'a-b-c'.replaceAll('-', '_')   // 'a_b_c'  — replace() only changes the first\n\n// repetition\n'ab'.repeat(3)            // 'ababab'\n\n// negative indexing\n'hello'.at(-1)            // 'o'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// content checks</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello world&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;world&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — replaces indexOf(...) !== -1</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;file.pdf&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">endsWith</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.pdf&#x27;</span>)         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://a.com&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">startsWith</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// padding to a length</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;5&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">padStart</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;005&#x27;  — sequence numbers, order codes</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;9&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">padEnd</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.&#x27;</span>)        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;9...&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// one-sided trimming</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;  x  &#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trimStart</span>()       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;x  &#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;  x  &#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trimEnd</span>()         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;  x&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// replace every occurrence</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a-b-c&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a_b_c&#x27;  — replace() only changes the first</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// repetition</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ab&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">repeat</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>)            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;ababab&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// negative indexing</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">at</span>(-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;o&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Two common follow-ups:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. <code>includes</code> is case-sensitive</strong> — normalize yourself for a case-insensitive check:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"a.toLowerCase().includes(b.toLowerCase())\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toLowerCase</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(b.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toLowerCase</span>())</code></pre></div><p><strong>2. <code>replaceAll</code> is safe with strings but requires the <code>g</code> flag with a regex:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"'a.b'.replaceAll('.', '-')      // 'a-b'\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./, '-')     // TypeError — missing g flag\n'a.b'.replaceAll(/\\./g, '-')    // 'a-b'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;.&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a-b&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/\\./</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TypeError — missing g flag</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/\\./g</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a-b&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Unicode caveat:</strong> these methods work on <strong>UTF-16 code units</strong>, so emoji and combining characters can surprise you.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">For true per-character work, use <code>Intl.Segmenter</code> or <code>[...str]</code>.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — String.prototype.padStart()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String/padStart"},{"label":"MDN — String.prototype.replaceAll()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String/replaceAll"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}